-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td></tr> <tr style="vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)"> <td style="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in">Lion Futures Limited</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c73" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipDate" id="ixv-7785">May 20, 2016</ix:nonNumeric></td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c73" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipState" id="ixv-7786">Hong Kong</ix:nonNumeric></td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c73" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipOwnershipInterest" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-7787">100</ix:nonFraction>%</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c73" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipBusinessPurpose" id="ixv-7788">Futures brokerage</ix:nonNumeric></td></tr> <tr style="vertical-align: top; "> <td style="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td></tr> <tr style="vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)"> <td style="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in">Lion Investment (Hong Kong) Limited (F/K/A Lion Foreign Exchange Limited)</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c74" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipDate" id="ixv-7789">May 20, 2016</ix:nonNumeric></td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c74" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipState" id="ixv-7790">Hong Kong</ix:nonNumeric></td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c74" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipOwnershipInterest" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-7791">100</ix:nonFraction>%</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c74" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipBusinessPurpose" id="ixv-7792">Dormant</ix:nonNumeric></td></tr> <tr style="vertical-align: top; "> <td style="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td>&#160;</td></tr> <tr style="vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)"> <td style="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in">Lion Wealth Limited (&#8220;LWL&#8221;)</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c75" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipDate" id="ixv-7793">October 4, 2018</ix:nonNumeric></td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c75" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipState" id="ixv-7794">Hong Kong</ix:nonNumeric></td> <td>&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: center"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c75" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipOwnershipInterest" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-7795">100</ix:nonFraction>%</td> <td>&#160;</td> <td><ix:no