fair value hierarchy for those assets and liabilities measured at fair value on a recurring basis at June 30, 2025 and December 31, 2024:</p></ix:nonNumeric>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

