</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_DebtDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:DebtDisclosureTextBlock" id="ixv-5188"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Note 9 &#8212; Convertible Debentures</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ConvertibleDebtTableTextBlock" id="ixv-5192"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The following represents a summary of all outstanding
convertible debentures presented on a combined basis which combines embedded derivative liabilities and convertible debentures at period
end.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

